language 0.1.0
module privacy
  means
    Lawful and purposeful handling of personal data throughout its lifecycle.

entity personal-data : thing
  means
    personal data: data relating to an identified or identifiable natural
    person.

entity data-subject : thing
  means
    data subject: the natural person to whom personal data relates.

entity processing : thing
  means
    processing: a single operation, or a coherent set of operations, upon
    personal data.

entity purpose : thing
  means
    purpose: the definite expected outcome for the sake of which personal data
    is processed.

entity legal-basis : thing
  means
    legal basis: an established ground making a definite processing of
    personal data admissible.

entity consent : thing
  means
    consent: a permission expressed by a data subject for definite processing
    for definite purposes.

entity retention-policy : thing
  means
    retention policy: the rules determining the term and conditions of keeping
    and deleting data.
